text AutomaticUpdate_Text1{
    "A new update has been applied.\p"
    "Things included in this update:\p"
    "1. New areas to explore.\p"
    "2. Some old areas have been updated.\n"
    "Some old events may have reset as\l"
    "a result.\p"
    "3. Followers, as well as setting a\n"
    "preferred follower from party screen.\p"
    "4. An updated “Stats” page in the\n"
    "start menu.\p"
    "5. New window frames available\n"
    "in the options menu.\p"
    "6. A lot of random bug fixes.\p"
    "7. The EV trainer in Pokémon Centers\n"
    "has been nerfed from 10 EV per\l"
    "Pokémon to 5."
}
text AutomaticUpdate2_Text2{
    "8. There is now a separate color\n"
    "switcher for the battle interface,\l"
    "as well as an ability to change\l"
    "window frames during battle.\p"
    "To cycle between colors, hold the\n"
    "START button during battle and press\l"
    "left and right on the D-Pad.\p"
    "To change window frames, hold the\n"
    "START button and press up and down\l"
    "on the D-Pad.\p"
    "The toggle between health numbers\n"
    "and bars in double battles has been\l"
    "moved to SELECT button."}
text AutomaticUpdate2_Text{
    "9. You have obtained a watch.\p"
    "You can now check the time by\n"
    "pressing the START button and can\l"
    "toggle between 12-hour and 24-hour\l"
    "modes through the options menu or\l"
    "by viewing a wall clock.\p"
    "Would you like to re-set the clock?\n"
    "Do note that this may have unintended\l"
    "consequences on time-related events,\l"
    "such as berry growth or daily events."
}
text BattleTentInRockliffe{
    "10. A new battle tent has opened in\n"
    "Rockliffe town."
}
text SceneAltered{
    "An earlier story scene of\n"
    "Team Rocket's assault on Devon\l"
    "Corp. has had its dialogue\l"
    "slightly altered, which affects\l"
    "the upcoming story.\p"
    "Would you like to view the\n"
    "altered scene?"
}

